  ('b7adfb89-503c-54a3-8c69-4a58c9b08b37', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92F', null, 'development', 'E-7', null, 'Sergeant First Class — Army career degrees', 'Chapter 7. MOS 92F Petroleum Supply Specialist', 'See SOCAD Army Career Degree Program. (h) GI to Jobs. See GI to Jobs COOL Website.', '89f2722b644654d6c57e608adaf80936b7cdc1a68cce9de47fce169e6f739fa1', 16, 16, null, 116, null, null, false, null),
  ('dc2432dd-25ab-5eae-82cd-1a4990998a30', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92F', null, 'training', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Institutional training', 'Chapter 7. MOS 92F Petroleum Supply Specialist', 'SGM-A', '9dd76cebaa7df888b4fa51b65c80bd2c31219d93a2969295e38d1a4de0e16af9', 16, 16, null, 117, null, null, false, null),
  ('7a598de3-9a9a-55db-95eb-8cb9532cb1a4', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92F', null, 'assignments', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Operational assignments', 'Chapter 7. MOS 92F Petroleum Supply Specialist', 'Assignments in Operational Army units as a First Sergeant, Operations Sergeant, Petroleum NCO, Petroleum Operations Sergeant, Petroleum Supply Sergeant, Plans and Operations NCO, Quality Assurance NCO, and Water Treatment Operations NCO. Critical Development time for First Sergeant is 24 months. Critical Development time for staff positions is 24 months.', '9245ce07ff2287586c3826e8beffa381345a0c5e77f7c74b592f6a077c9106f1', 16, 16, null, 118, null, null, false, null),
  ('ef084b7c-35bf-5584-b167-3416bf658a09', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92F', null, 'development', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — TDA assignments', 'Chapter 7. MOS 92F Petroleum Supply Specialist', 'Master Sergeants selected for TDA gain a different perspective of the unique challenges other than the operational Army. They will receive specialized training and, in some cases, access credentialing. These tours should be limited to one (1) three-year tour, with the exception of those personnel required to complete a broadening tour in support of Army requirements. TDA assignments include Enlisted Aide, Senior Instructor, Operations NCO (DLA), Plans and Operations NCO, Quality Assurance NCO, Inspector General NCO, Equal Opportunity Advisor, Training with Industry (TWI), and Senior Career Management NCO.', 'd4251e1e5724a636e9ef714811a77a03e441a43e48e2216b4acbb3500e691330', 16, 16, null, 119, null, null, false, null),
  ('b4cea15a-76c0-5db4-bf49-f1136a8d8ce1', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92F', null, 'self_development', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Self-Development', 'Chapter 7. MOS 92F Petroleum Supply Specialist', 'For additional information on self-development, refer to chapter 3; Army Career Tracker (ACT)_at https://actnow.army.mil; TC 7-22.7; Army Training Information System (ATIS) at https://www.pdmatis.army.mil/', '8c4b5532cccd65240ca7cff2892a618c49383db0d77bb70cde6d34f26728476d', 17, 17, null, 120, null, null, false, null),
  ('afdb8e1e-bd76-5b31-b0e4-fd3de2a7e6d9', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92F', null, 'training', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Additional Training', 'Chapter 7. MOS 92F Petroleum Supply Specialist', ', Airborne, Jumpmaster, Air Assault, Ranger, Battle Staff Course, Support Operations Course, Master Resilience Trainer- Assistant Primary Instructor, Culture and Language, Joint Logistics Course, Operational Contract Support, Contracting Officer Representative (COR), Quality assurance of Into-Plane Servicing Contracts (J07), Petroleum In-Plant Quality Assurance (J20), Joint Petroleum Course (JPC 200), Theatre Sustainment Planners/Joint Logistics, Inspector General, and Enlisted Aide Training Course. (d) Special assignments. 1) Broadening Assignments: Senior Instructor, Senior Career Management NCO, Course Manger, Defense Logistics Agency (DLA), Observer/Controller Trainer, Equal Opportunity Advisor, Inspector General NCO, Enlisted Aide, and Training with Industry (TWI). 2) MOS Enhancing: Ranger Battalion, Special Mission Units, or Special Operations assignments.', '625616f9de23a5241b1b13343488996259831fb81859e67cea50ecb5c1aefb3a', 17, 17, null, 121, null, null, false, null),
  ('b6507a95-b33d-58bc-90cf-e61b341105d5', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92F', null, 'development', 'E-9', null, 'Sergeant Major/Command Sergeant Major — overview', 'Chapter 7. MOS 92F Petroleum Supply Specialist', 'Sergeant Majors/Command Sergeant Majors with the MOS 92A, 92Y,92F, 92G, 92M, 92R, and 92S convert to MOS 92Z, Senior Noncommissioned Logistician, See section 10-92Z. MOS 92Z—Senior Noncommissioned Logistician, CMF 92 within the Smartbook DA Pam 611-21 located at https://www.milsuite.mil/.', '899dbf1b2ba2d7d6dd16c723253da534877faf7046fb7b9e18d286b256aafb4d', 17, 17, null, 122, null, null, false, null),
  ('98959f5a-e9c2-556e-914b-f161852cd81d', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'development', null, null, 'Goals for development', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'Culinary Specialists must focus and become proficient in the skill of their MOS and continue to broaden their knowledge that will reflect positively later in their careers. Warrior Tasks and Battle Drills cannot be overlooked; the Quartermaster Soldier should sharpen the tactical skills needed to survive on the battlefield and strive for excellence during the ACFT and weapons qualification.', '29ebbe593143e55d553cec824043a63bae32bf93a485b382a137c32c4df93549', 19, 19, null, 123, null, null, false, null),
  ('3af90725-701b-547b-8238-80fad1bcb32d', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'training', 'E-1..E-4', null, 'Private E-1–Specialist/Corporal — Institutional Training', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'IET, Reclassification, and BLC.', '3eabfa175c4c11850585ad1a19dfa95d1f3612089f88bd928e8c5cce18e95082', 19, 19, null, 124, null, null, false, null),
  ('841a2664-8af9-5363-ac82-0d64786ac17a', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'assignments', 'E-1..E-4', null, 'Private E-1–Specialist/Corporal — Operational assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'Assignments in Operational Army units as a Culinary Specialist.', 'f167217e71fbe3d78bcb817d811d923c4cf638fbf21355e6a3e2b43aae6b5407', 19, 19, null, 125, null, null, false, null),
  ('9f4103b5-2531-5c21-a898-bdf55e4d95fa', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'development', 'E-1..E-4', null, 'Private E-1–Specialist/Corporal — TDA assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'Soldiers selected for TDA gain a different perspective of the unique challenges other than the operational Army. They will receive specialized training and, in some cases, access credentialing. These tours should be limited to one (1) three-year tour. TDA assignments include Food Operations, and Food Service Specialist.', '13623bf8f4914253145c8b701eb2f7b9b1e2401453e28ad8ba3272c59f83af87', 20, 20, null, 126, null, null, false, null),
  ('8a81029d-58c4-579c-aa28-42bd75bffaec', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'self_development', 'E-1..E-4', null, 'Private E-1–Specialist/Corporal — self-development', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'For additional information on self-development, refer to chapter 3; Army Career Tracker (ACT) https://actnow.army.mil; TC 7-22.7; Army Training Information System (ATIS) at https://www.pdmatis.army.mil/.', 'e3f202a27612ce2d738c420579fd80b4cbf13d4f29db840b814f77925c6e3a7c', 20, 20, null, 127, null, null, false, null),
  ('313f87b6-67b1-5f6b-b299-a8a304ce53a7', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'training', 'E-1..E-4', null, 'Private E-1–Specialist/Corporal — Additional Training', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'Combatives 1, Combat lifesaver, Field Sanitation, Airborne, Air Assault, Ranger, and Advanced Culinary Skills Course.', '926d8f96cc9d47bab317512571aab927e720de372384cca55055b23a12e8d229', 20, 20, null, 128, null, null, false, null),
  ('adf74a41-c2d3-5b93-834a-38a8ca7c17a0', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'assignments', 'E-1..E-4', null, 'Private E-1–Specialist/Corporal — Special assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'Special assignments 1) Broadening Assignments: Special Operations and Executive Mess Steward. 2) MOS Enhancing: Ranger Battalion, Special Mission Units, or Special Operations assignments.', '56887294f5b0d2f1a647aaef11206e3b84964c3984015853612135ee2cc3609f', 20, 20, null, 129, null, null, false, null),
  ('837c168b-f4d9-5a85-96c1-c1402587dd71', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'training', 'E-5', null, 'Sergeant — Institutional training', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'ALC and Reclassification.', 'cf63d356c621c858c25193d29febe2bcb14d92ae16c3f8e8fcc8fd8e148accdf', 20, 20, null, 130, null, null, false, null),
  ('9bdd6cc4-89c9-5551-901c-156568355ac9', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'assignments', 'E-5', null, 'Sergeant — Operational assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'The critical developmental assignment for an MOS 92G Sergeant as a Field Feeding/Forward Support Company Team/Squad Leader or serving on staff for 18-24 months. Although the proponent recommends all MOS 92G Sergeants serve a minimum of 18 months as a Field Feeding/Forward Support Company Team Leader or on staff prior to being assigned to other leadership duties in operational units, unit strengths, operational requirements, and unit priorities may require Commanders and Command Sergeant Majors to move Sergeants prior to meeting this requirement. Assignments in Operational Army units as a Culinary NCO, Culinary Specialist, Food Service Sergeant, and Field Feeding/Forward Support Company Team/Squad Leader.', '0f3cc85e8bc23941f8c186be97b3a9731da1ccc90c5a82d68e598a5138c4d25d', 20, 20, null, 131, null, null, false, null),
  ('62b3d12b-acdb-5c61-8139-407cf4420bd6', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'development', 'E-5', null, 'Sergeant — TDA assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'Sergeants selected for TDA gain a different perspective of the unique challenges other than the operational Army. They will receive specialized training and, in some cases, access credentialing. These tours should be limited to one three-year tour, with the exception of those personnel required to complete a broadening tour in support of Army requirements. TDA assignments include Drill Sergeant, Recruiter, Flight Steward, Culinary NCO, Operations NCO, Direct Support Training to the Environment (DSTE) NCO, and Food Operations Manager (Culinary Outpost Manager/Shift Leader).', 'ef95e92ca7a3727345fe677b73055bff81a247315c9f0e8d968a89c7435fc43f', 20, 20, null, 132, null, null, false, null),
  ('a99f6922-8a14-5cc8-b39f-039a07382401', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'self_development', 'E-5', null, 'Sergeant — Self-development', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'For additional information on self-development, refer to chapter 3; Army Career Tracker (ACT) at https://actnow.army.mil; TC 7-22.7; Army Training Information System (ATIS) at https://www.pdmatis.army.mil/', '515f219fb8e169a536b2385da6b4b99e2c10f1e12bc930b9951996b218903d5c', 20, 20, null, 133, null, null, false, null),
  ('6f61b0cf-5a6e-5725-9985-dacb94c15111', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'training', 'E-5', null, 'Sergeant — Additional training', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'Contracting Officer Representative (COR), Combatives 2, Combat lifesaver, Field Sanitation, Airborne, Jumpmaster, Air Assault, ServSafe Certification Course, Ranger, Master Resiliency Trainer, Master Fitness Trainer, Equal Opportunity Leader, Enlisted Aide Training Course, and Advance Culinary Skills Training Course.', '2feed4095864c182af6f33b9e034809707a1a598b1f3cfcf04b0f8eb632f1236', 20, 20, null, 134, null, null, false, null),
  ('78079852-8dcf-550e-888a-64484d466ee8', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'assignments', 'E-5', null, 'Sergeant — Special assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', '1) Broadening Assignments: Drill Sergeant, Executive Mess Steward, Enlisted Aide, Flight Steward and Protocol Assistant. 2) MOS Enhancing: Credentialing and competitive boards (see ACT Career map), Ranger Battalion, Special Mission Units, or Special Operations assignments.', 'e09f20604e68aa005cdd8ab1af522ec002ce006d66ec6e7a1711fb474fd8051b', 20, 20, null, 135, null, null, false, null),
  ('7a6868d1-75df-5a6e-948d-46b3be4f969f', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'training', 'E-6', null, 'Staff Sergeant — Institutional training', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'SLC and Reclassification.', '89465a136a1bc1d444b6ef3a5cb30f668f135a6ec2e7ca121e3e36965ce77e32', 20, 20, null, 136, null, null, false, null),
  ('1762ab92-0554-556d-b856-61aea093c1f5', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'assignments', 'E-6', null, 'Staff Sergeant — Operational assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'The critical developmental assignment for an MOS 92G Staff Sergeant as a Field Feeding/Forward Support Company Squad Leader/Platoon Sergeant for 24 months or serving on staff for 24 months. Although the proponent recommends all MOS 92G Staff Sergeants serve a minimum of 24 months as a Field Feeding/Forward Support Company Team/Squad Leader or on staff prior to being assigned to other leadership duties in operational units, unit strengths, operational requirements, and unit priorities may require Commanders and CSMs to move Staff Sergeants prior to meeting this requirement. Assignments in Operational Army units as a Advanced Culinary NCO, Assistant Warrior Restaurant Manager, Food Service Sergeant, Culinary Specialist, and Field Feeding/Forward Support Company Team/Squad Leader or Platoon Sergeant.', '42741c60a50e2637697123ecc0c00a76067cb28ff6aaac1f04bc4facc56a2352', 20, 21, null, 137, null, null, false, null),
  ('b98e34fa-2943-5b05-8776-2da3c9124f0f', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'development', 'E-6', null, 'Staff Sergeant — TDA assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'Staff Sergeants selected for TDA gain a different perspective of the unique challenges other than the operational Army. They will receive specialized training and, in some cases, access credentialing. These tours should be limited to one three-year tour, with the exception of those personnel required to complete a broadening tour in support of Army requirements. TDA assignments include Instructor/Small Group Leader, Enlisted Aide, Recruiter, Enlisted Aide Apprenticeship, Operations Sergeant, Food Service Sergeant, Mess Steward, Flight Steward, and Squad Leader.', '84efde3de81fbc8fa53bccade306c8c2babb0ab16a0441ea1fc3d1c475a46993', 21, 21, null, 138, null, null, false, null),
  ('ae094ff7-9b32-5f22-aef5-27bc6233d2e9', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'self_development', 'E-6', null, 'Staff Sergeant — Self-development', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'For additional information on self-development, refer to TC 7-22.7 The NCO Guide. ACT https://actnow.army.mil.', 'a6a8c97bcbc0c78067ea3e7525108ea7435be620f0f97a6f2cedaa3cd3454c84', 21, 21, null, 139, null, null, false, null),
  ('8693c274-c3dd-55ba-9913-15714add9f73', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'training', 'E-6', null, 'Staff Sergeant — Additional Training', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', ', Airborne, Jumpmaster, Air Assault, Ranger, Master Resiliency Trainer, Master Fitness Trainer, Sling Load Inspector Certification Course (SLICC), , Battle Staff, Master Driver Trainer, Sexual Harassment/Assault Response and Prevention (SHARP), Support Operations Course, Contracting Officer Representative (COR), GCSS-A, and HAZMAT course, Enlisted Aide Training Course (ASI Z5), Advance Culinary Skills Course, and Food Service Contracting Course, Food Service Management Course after 24 Months TIG or upon SLC completion, ServSafe Certification Course, and Enlisted Aide Apprenticeship.', 'befee353148a0bcad9820f24f4c98af337b1ee9e1d0371404d136556cd9f235d', 21, 21, null, 140, null, null, false, null),
  ('3434640d-d9cf-5411-8ea7-6e9a76968bd4', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'assignments', 'E-6', null, 'Staff Sergeant — Special assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', '1) Broadening Assignments: Instructor, Drill Sergeant, Recruiter, Flight Steward, Small Group Leader, Enlisted Aide, Training with Industry (TWI), Inspector General NCO, and Executive Mess Steward. 2) MOS Enhancing: Shift Leader; Ranger Battalion, Special Mission Units, or Special Operations assignments, Credentialing, and competitive boards (see ACT Career map).', 'bea40d6891e4fbcda1b8a1c7ab9a2beb7a044477c627fe2994e75629395151ef', 21, 21, null, 141, null, null, false, null),
  ('f9bf42e9-6002-5d18-ad2f-56859691e293', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'training', 'E-7', null, 'Sergeant First Class — Institutional training', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'MLC and Reclassification.', 'ed9311ac4790ece28b2d6195d74ee44e265d355c90ab296c515eecc651806c43', 21, 21, null, 142, null, null, false, null),
  ('4ec81b53-a505-5ab3-bd01-a5b615165d4a', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'assignments', 'E-7', null, 'Sergeant First Class — Operational assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'The critical developmental assignment for an MOS 92G Sergeant First Class as a Platoon Sergeant 18-24 month or serving on staff for 24-36 months. Although the proponent recommends all MOS 92G Sergeant First Class’s serve a minimum of 18 months as a Platoon Sergeant or on staff prior to being assigned to other leadership duties in operational units, unit strengths, operational requirements, and unit priorities may require Commanders and Command Sergeant Majors to move Sergeant First Class’s prior to meeting this requirement. Assignments in Operational Army units as a Platoon Sergeant, Assistant Warrior Restaurant Manager, Warrior Restaurant Manager, First Sergeant, Culinary Management NCO, Culinary Specialist, Food Operations Management NCO, Food Service Sergeant, and Food Service Specialist.', '8d87eacbbeada422d14acbf288af0ff6f40aa1867269b78a695faabf447ad19a', 21, 21, null, 143, null, null, false, null),
  ('fcaf5816-2d42-5377-b80e-3d34242437f9', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'development', 'E-7', null, 'Sergeant First Class — TDA assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'Sergeant First Class’s selected for TDA gain a different perspective of the unique challenges other than the operational Army. They will receive specialized training and, in some cases, access credentialing. These tours should be limited to one three-year tour, with the exception of those personnel required to complete a broadening tour in support of Army requirements. TDA assignments include Drill Sergeant, Instructor, Enlisted Aide, Enlisted Aide Apprenticeship, Observer/Controller NCO, Culinary Management NCO, Protocol NCOIC, Flight Steward, Equal Opportunity Advisor, Operations/Project NCO, and Talent Management NCO/Training Developer.', 'e4b61d040fd4916e19fb33c34d3cabd751316904fcd208a1c3e55a297309f7e6', 21, 21, null, 144, null, null, false, null),
  ('e16d89dc-ef95-5ec3-a6bf-c3631122bed1', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'self_development', 'E-7', null, 'Sergeant First Class — Self-Development', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'For additional information on self-development, refer to chapter 3; Army Career Tracker (ACT) at https://actnow.army.mil; TC 7-22.7; Army Training Information System (ATIS) at https://www.pdmatis.army.mil/.', '7345beb1d9eab7bc9ff4d40e11cfed7f7dc794420c71074b13e9a2d06abd0275', 21, 21, null, 145, null, null, false, null),
  ('e749b0b2-ee64-5c2e-858e-6c2b7caa1c7f', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'training', 'E-7', null, 'Sergeant First Class — Additional Training', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'Airborne, Jumpmaster, Air Assault, Ranger, Master Fitness Trainer, Master Driver Trainer, Sexual Harassment/Assault Response and Prevention (SHARP), Equal Opportunity Advisor, HAZMAT Course, Battle Staff, Sling Load Inspector Certification Course (SLICC), Support Operations Course, Operational Contracting Support, Joint Logistics Course, Contracting Officer Representative (COR), Master Resiliency Trainer, and Enlisted Aide Training Course.', 'e61c4f13a8131ec4bc77293a0c7a36774f62155780246c44e5475c54956c2353', 21, 21, null, 146, null, null, false, null),
  ('a994cf08-9f8a-5f6b-b442-0da41fd0aa0e', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'assignments', 'E-7', null, 'Sergeant First Class — Special assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', '1) Broadening Assignments: Drill Sergeant, Recruiter, Instructor, Senior Instructor, Senior Small Group Leader, ALC Small Group Leader Training Development NCO, Enlisted Aide, Inspector General, Career Management NCO, Training with Industry, Equal Opportunity Advisor, Army Executive Dining Facility NCOIC, Flight Steward Executive Mess Program, Secretary of Defense Mess, Talent Management NCO, and Sexual Assault Response Coordinator (SARC). 2) MOS Enhancing: Warrior Restaurant/Food Operations Manager, Credentialing, and competitive boards (see ACT Career map), Ranger Battalion or any Special Operations and Special Mission Unit assignments.', '45ef47756306b20bf11b3c3904940e835135f83805bbcb20f24554a998885f5b', 21, 22, null, 147, null, null, false, null),
  ('54551234-354a-5211-88f0-70e49a63d61e', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'development', 'E-7', null, 'Sergeant First Class — Army career degrees', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'See SOCAD Army Career Degree Program. (h) GI to Jobs. See GI to Jobs COOL Website.', '89f2722b644654d6c57e608adaf80936b7cdc1a68cce9de47fce169e6f739fa1', 22, 22, null, 148, null, null, false, null),
  ('6e68363b-cfb6-56c5-8bf3-67406d666fb8', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'training', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Institutional training', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'SGM-A and Reclassification.', '17fbb9827ac2f69049a8e91666a6870cfa0f632216ff4234085cd0b857c1e18b', 22, 22, null, 149, null, null, false, null),
  ('b18e2e38-dc97-5d3a-b3e0-2039edc476d0', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'assignments', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Operational assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'The critical developmental assignment for an MOS 92G Master Sergeant as a First Sergeant for 18- 24 months or serving on staff for 18-24 months. Assignments in Operational Army units as a First Sergeant, Operations Sergeant, Food Operations Management NCO, and Senior Culinary Management NCO. Critical Development time for leadership positions will be 18-24 months.', '59b965307fe124fc25a4d88913a20db74ff3b576ce93768f5a06d0fd664cfe2c', 22, 22, null, 150, null, null, false, null),
  ('c150104c-5964-5fad-b8d5-304779d9434b', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'development', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — TDA assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'Master Sergeants selected for TDA gain a different perspective of the unique challenges other than the operational Army. They will receive specialized training and, in some cases, access credentialing. These tours should be limited to one three-year tour, with the exception of those personnel required to complete a broadening tour in support of Army requirements. TDA assignments include Enlisted Aide, Enlisted Aide, Senior Instructor, Command Food Service NCOIC, AFRICOM Mess NCOIC, Operations Sergeant and Training Developer.', '87ade2c46d32661c9bbc6361508c51c48e4f5330eb7ad6db1429dc7585b3c6c7', 22, 22, null, 151, null, null, false, null),
  ('2f70ea2b-acae-5bcb-b709-2efbaa341251', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'self_development', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Self-Development', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'For additional information on self-development, refer to chapter 3; Army Career Tracker (ACT) at https://actnow.army.mil; TC 7-22.7; Army Training Information System (ATIS) at https://www.pdmatis.army.mil/.', '7345beb1d9eab7bc9ff4d40e11cfed7f7dc794420c71074b13e9a2d06abd0275', 22, 22, null, 152, null, null, false, null),
  ('ec430015-ae92-50ec-9569-0cad6a9de41f', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'training', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Additional Training', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', ', Airborne, Jumpmaster, Air Assault, Ranger, Battle Staff Course, Support Operations Course, Operational Contracting Support Course, Master Resiliency Trainer, HAZMAT Course, Inspector General, Equal Opportunity Advisor, GCSS-Army Material Managers Course, Contracting Officer Representative (COR), Master Fitness Trainer, Food Service Management Course, Food Service Contract Management Course, Advance Culinary Arts Skills Training Course, Enlisted Aide Training Course, Joint Logistics Course, Training Management Course, and Joint Logistics Training Course.', 'c992321cd70fc718229aff7caeae9b75bb5420d4e94e32cc273310bc5271cfd9', 22, 22, null, 153, null, null, false, null),
  ('0737a15c-1e5f-5a0a-8639-3cb31b1e67ce', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'assignments', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Special assignments', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', '1) Broadening Assignments: Senior Instructor Supervisor, Equal Opportunity Advisor, Inspector General, Flight Steward, Enlisted Aide Instructor, Executive Mess Steward, Presidential Enlisted Aide, and Enlisted Aide or Senior Enlisted Aide Advisor. 2) MOS Enhancing: Credentialing and competitive boards (see ACT Career map), Ranger Battalion, Special Mission Units, or Special Operations/ Joint assignments.', '0c7692f8ef310f2572c5e82dd4c3e15ef0ac9165a9d2865f3a86362f77054719', 22, 22, null, 154, null, null, false, null),
  ('13d96425-049b-5ca2-b492-b28ad02e2b93', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'development', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Army career degrees', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'See SOCAD Army Career Degree Program. (h) GI to Jobs. See GI to Jobs COOL Website.', '89f2722b644654d6c57e608adaf80936b7cdc1a68cce9de47fce169e6f739fa1', 22, 22, null, 155, null, null, false, null),
  ('8db1dc91-282c-5ff8-8d73-3c120c4a5c7c', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92G', null, 'development', 'E-9', null, 'Sergeant Major/Command Sergeant Major — overview', 'Chapter 10. MOS 92G Culinary Specialist', 'Sergeant Majors/Command Sergeant Majors with the MOS 92A, 92Y,92F, 92G, 92M, 92R, and 92S convert to MOS 92Z, Senior Noncommissioned Logistician, See section 10-92Z. MOS 92Z—Senior Noncommissioned Logistician, CMF 92 within Smartbook DA Pam 611-21 located at https://www.milsuite.mil/.', 'd84bb937819d1fe4087b8d71a1db1541a57b55cc39a2d7d2471016b86ccd538a', 22, 22, null, 156, null, null, false, null),
  ('db32b1a2-4394-5266-88a1-9209e4f01493', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92L', null, 'development', null, null, 'Goals for development', 'Chapter 13. MOS 92L Petroleum Laboratory Specialist', 'Petroleum Laboratory Specialist must focus and become proficient in the skills of their MOS and continue to broaden their knowledge that will in turn reflect on them positively later in their careers. Warrior Tasks and Battle Drills cannot be overlooked; the Quartermaster Soldier should hone the tactical skills needed to survive on the battlefield and strive for excellence during the ACFT and weapons qualification.', '1cebf6cac5103d492651fac6acdf58ffa1260c9040ba01004f541374861b4743', 23, 23, null, 157, null, null, false, null),
  ('5caf213d-21f5-5afd-8094-226460edf8fb', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92L', null, 'training', 'E-1..E-4', null, 'Private E-1–Specialist/Corporal — Institutional Training', 'Chapter 13. MOS 92L Petroleum Laboratory Specialist', 'IET, Reclassification, and BLC.', '3eabfa175c4c11850585ad1a19dfa95d1f3612089f88bd928e8c5cce18e95082', 23, 23, null, 158, null, null, false, null),
