  ('f5ec8c4b-de2c-5838-b6c8-0227817059af', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92L', null, 'assignments', 'E-1..E-4', null, 'Private E-1–Specialist/Corporal — Special assignments', 'Chapter 13. MOS 92L Petroleum Laboratory Specialist', 'Special assignments 1) Broadening Assignments: None. 2) MOS Enhancing: Ranger Battalion, Special Mission Units, or Special Operations assignments.', 'd1f10ac9da4393dc563d0966266ba392e0cecc38b1b86a6b5036dbfe8131ef59', 23, 24, null, 163, null, null, false, null),
  ('3043c509-5072-5620-a8f2-52ed8c0ada9e', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92L', null, 'training', 'E-5', null, 'Sergeant — Institutional training', 'Chapter 13. MOS 92L Petroleum Laboratory Specialist', 'ALC, and Reclassification.', '99e4a03b5fb8659059a8a19e1ce05dc0c7a20317e25f0f32ac722f1cee0fc896', 24, 24, null, 164, null, null, false, null),
  ('2e5e2911-f781-56f0-a33d-9d2e176afe9d', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92L', null, 'assignments', 'E-5', null, 'Sergeant — Operational assignments', 'Chapter 13. MOS 92L Petroleum Laboratory Specialist', 'The critical developmental assignment for an MOS 92L Sergeant as a Team Leader/Squad Leader (Additional Duty), for 24 months or serving on staff for 24 months. Although the proponent recommends all MOS 92L Sergeants serve a minimum of 24 months as a Team Leader/Squad Leader (Additional Duty), prior to being assigned to other leadership duties in operational units, unit strengths, operational requirements, and unit priorities may require Commanders and Command Sergeant Majors to move Sergeants prior to meeting this requirement. Assignments in Operational Army units as a, Petroleum Supply Sergeant, Petroleum Laboratory Sergeant, and Quality Assurance Specialist.', '01f5ee17bab2fbc3eaf0ffe257ffe5e8c6b7da0442f397840e9058b2b1757ae6', 24, 24, null, 165, null, null, false, null),
  ('e26c87d4-894b-5146-b88d-e093d20b36dc', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92L', null, 'development', 'E-5', null, 'Sergeant — TDA assignments', 'Chapter 13. MOS 92L Petroleum Laboratory Specialist', 'Sergeants selected for TDA gain a different perspective of the unique challenges other than the operational Army. They will receive specialized training and, in some cases, access credentialing. These tours should be limited to (one) three-year tour, with the exception of those personnel required to complete a broadening tour in support of Army requirements. TDA assignments include Drill Sergeant, Recruiter, and Petroleum Supply Specialist (DSTE).', '8760e72c5d725a2bbfc94b59b74056f88738093e20f0313d22ca5ebd7675e0a9', 24, 24, null, 166, null, null, false, null),
  ('b57a1e14-17e9-57f1-9007-abb8a6d1282f', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92L', null, 'self_development', 'E-5', null, 'Sergeant — Self-development', 'Chapter 13. MOS 92L Petroleum Laboratory Specialist', 'For additional information on self-development, refer to chapter 3; Army Career Tracker (ACT) at https://actnow.army.mil; TC 7-22.7; Army Training Information System (ATIS) at https://www.pdmatis.army.mil/', '515f219fb8e169a536b2385da6b4b99e2c10f1e12bc930b9951996b218903d5c', 24, 24, null, 167, null, null, false, null),
