  ('b218e117-01e4-5c55-887c-58b37d012228', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92M', null, 'training', 'E-5', null, 'Sergeant — Institutional training', 'Chapter 16. MOS 92M Mortuary Affairs Specialist/Fatality Management Specialist', 'ALC and Reclassification.', 'cf63d356c621c858c25193d29febe2bcb14d92ae16c3f8e8fcc8fd8e148accdf', 25, 25, null, 177, null, null, false, null),
  ('17bb9ae1-5468-5414-bf56-00b01aae5531', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92M', null, 'assignments', 'E-5', null, 'Sergeant — Operational assignments', 'Chapter 16. MOS 92M Mortuary Affairs Specialist/Fatality Management Specialist', 'The critical developmental assignment for an MOS 92M Sergeant as a Squad Leader for 12 months or serving on staff for 18-24 months. Although the proponent recommends all MOS 92M Sergeants serve a minimum of 12 months as a Squad Leader prior to being assigned to other leadership duties in operational units, unit strengths, operational requirements, and unit priorities may require Commanders and Command Sergeant Majors to move Sergeants prior to meeting this requirement. Assignments in Operational Army units as a Squad Leader and Fatality Management NCO.', 'a2efce15d703e739660416089f9cd920b191948bece30c5d6c509cf36b0dfb8c', 25, 26, null, 178, null, null, false, null),
  ('68051a32-aa52-5e3c-887c-720d7c0833b5', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92M', null, 'development', 'E-5', null, 'Sergeant — TDA assignments', 'Chapter 16. MOS 92M Mortuary Affairs Specialist/Fatality Management Specialist', 'Sergeants selected for TDA gain a different perspective of the unique challenges other than the operational Army. They will receive specialized training and, in some cases, access credentialing. These tours should be limited to one (1) three- year tour, except for those personnel required to complete a broadening tour in support of Army requirement. TDA assignments include Fatality Management NCO., Recovery NCO, and Worldwide OPS CTR NCO.
(c) Self-Development. For additional information on self-development, refer to TC 7-22.7 The NCO Guide. ACT https://actnow.army.mil.', '7bc1b29b48ab4e301b896caa2ab1624473a8a75d9b3ee58ac8d84b3ae4b89e9d', 26, 26, null, 179, null, null, false, null),
