  ('661448bb-e62f-5a17-8c3b-5afcf04f0c54', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92S', null, 'development', 'E-1..E-4', null, 'Private E-1–Specialist/Corporal — TDA assignments', 'Chapter 22. MOS 92S Shower/Laundry Specialist', 'Soldiers selected for TDA gain a different perspective of the unique challenges other than the operational Army. They will receive specialized training and, in some cases, access credentialing. These tours should be limited to one (1) three-year tour. TDA assignments include Shower and Laundry Specialist.', '4cbcdd64ab99f82217717a9d480f47eca83a6cf33e093c9f7b9c77f4cf7c78a6', 32, 32, null, 238, null, null, false, null),
