  ('d7512633-7c60-57d3-9081-842df00cf826', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92Y', null, 'training', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Institutional training', 'Chapter 28. MOS 92Y Unit Supply Specialist', 'SGM-A', '9dd76cebaa7df888b4fa51b65c80bd2c31219d93a2969295e38d1a4de0e16af9', 41, 41, null, 317, null, null, false, null),
  ('5f37fd3e-6b79-5d23-9eee-5869c8810b55', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92Y', null, 'assignments', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Operational assignments', 'Chapter 28. MOS 92Y Unit Supply Specialist', 'Critical Development is recommended 24 months as a 1SG and 24 months in a staff position. Assignments in Operational Army units as a First Sergeant, Operations Sergeant, and Senior Supply Sergeant.', 'a8a19f19809ce60a1cea834047f866e15b4a3c0690b31efca25ea6cff3123c8e', 41, 41, null, 318, null, null, false, null),
  ('d2e1c097-d2d9-521f-8488-5c5e606d0280', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92Y', null, 'development', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — TDA assignments', 'Chapter 28. MOS 92Y Unit Supply Specialist', 'Master Sergeants selected for TDA gain a different perspective of the unique challenges other than the operational Army. They will receive specialized training and, in some cases, access credentialing. These tours should be limited to one three-year tour, with the exception of those personnel required to complete a broadening tour in support of Army requirement. TDA assignments include, SR Instructor, BSB Log OPS SGT OC/T, Logistics SPT OPS NCO, FSC HQ OC, Logistics SNCO, Property Coordinator NCO, BCT S4 NCO OC/T, SR Battle Staff OC/T, SR Log SVC SUPV, Logistics NCO, Material MGT NCO, Unit Supply NCO, and S4/SPO NCOIC.', '2453bca6636f62aab5d3a0098a125cda302d454099549129ca255eb4947858de', 41, 41, null, 319, null, null, false, null),
  ('8fa2a316-9ba7-5dd5-84ce-e6616d79ca44', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92Y', null, 'self_development', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Self-Development', 'Chapter 28. MOS 92Y Unit Supply Specialist', 'For additional information on self-development, refer to chapter 3; Army Career Tracker (ACT) at https://actnow.army.mil; TC 7-22.7; Army Training Information System (ATIS) at https://www.pdmatis.army.mil/', '515f219fb8e169a536b2385da6b4b99e2c10f1e12bc930b9951996b218903d5c', 41, 41, null, 320, null, null, false, null),
  ('9b964cef-d994-526d-9e42-211a5dd608b2', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92Y', null, 'training', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Additional Training', 'Chapter 28. MOS 92Y Unit Supply Specialist', 'Airborne, Jumpmaster, GCSS-Army Material Managers Course, Contracting Officer Representative (COR), Support Operations, Master Fitness Trainer, Master Resiliency Trainer, Air Assault, Ranger, Enlisted Aide Training Course, Joint Logistics Course, “How the Army Runs” Course, NBC Course.', 'a62309a9debaeeda80f1113d36d5be6405de8d9edbb7c8cf6affa40cf404b50f', 41, 41, null, 321, null, null, false, null),
  ('b7149abe-da19-528f-a3b1-6f0e508a370b', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92Y', null, 'assignments', 'E-8', null, 'Master Sergeant/First Sergeant — Special assignments', 'Chapter 28. MOS 92Y Unit Supply Specialist', '1) Broadening Assignments: Enlisted Personnel Development NCO, SR Career Manager, Equal Opportunity Advisor, DLA, Inspector General NCO, and Enlisted Aide. 2) MOS Enhancing: Security Force Assistance Brigade (SFAB), Ranger BN or any Special Operations assignment.', '3825acc5ce988db39a9074d4f4ec72d5d84dcebb5c0e9dbb0d262721e68de0a2', 41, 41, null, 322, null, null, false, null),
  ('f3568da3-157e-5af3-8245-d467eac2b9f9', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92Y', null, 'development', 'E-9', null, 'Sergeant Major/Command Sergeant Major — overview', 'Chapter 28. MOS 92Y Unit Supply Specialist', 'Sergeant Majors/Command Sergeant Majors with the MOS 92A, 92Y,92F, 92G, 92M, 92R, and 92S convert to MOS 92Z, Senior Noncommissioned Logistician, See section 10-92Z. MOS 92Z—Senior Noncommissioned Logistician, CMF 92 within Smartbook DA Pam 611-21 located at https://www.milsuite.mil/.', 'd84bb937819d1fe4087b8d71a1db1541a57b55cc39a2d7d2471016b86ccd538a', 41, 42, null, 323, null, null, false, null),
  ('f9c6b746-92fc-5273-a6ec-a1ad12e8f634', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92Z', null, 'training', 'E-9', null, 'Sergeant Major/ Command Sergeant Major — Institutional training', 'Chapter 32. Military occupational specialty 92Z professional development model', 'SGM-A, Pre-Command Course for selected Sergeant Majors.', '1af9f5ec43a76f17246e229f90ef7e3e065ef35ceda39b26204ab840b8a5b000', 43, 43, null, 324, null, null, false, null),
  ('5cbbfe50-4e6d-5bd2-80c8-7b6e18c8241d', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92Z', null, 'assignments', 'E-9', null, 'Sergeant Major/ Command Sergeant Major — Operational assignments', 'Chapter 32. Military occupational specialty 92Z professional development model', 'Sergeant Major and Command Sergeant Major (92Z) is the capstone MOS for 92A, 92Y,92F, 92G, 92M, 92R, and 92S. Assignments in Operational Army units as a', '72d0dbd905180a51968c99c79f0c79011f4f93b006c9737d4d33eb9376d1b352', 43, 43, null, 325, null, null, false, null),
  ('c742e15a-1174-5d8e-b6f4-045db300f40f', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92Z', null, 'development', 'E-9', null, 'Sergeant Major/ Command Sergeant Major — Additional guidance', 'Chapter 32. Military occupational specialty 92Z professional development model', 'Airdrop OPS SGM; Joint Mortuary Affairs Center SGM; DA Connelly SGM; Army Food Service SGM; G-4 SGM; SPO SGM; Operations SGM; Battalion CSM; Brigade CSM.', '40dacf7baf80d46af27da994e5ee98765aa9c1b902b720e6ec4763f35d9cb22b', 43, 43, null, 326, null, null, false, null),
  ('b34fc669-034d-5645-9b7a-41e45219a48b', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92Z', null, 'self_development', 'E-9', null, 'Sergeant Major/ Command Sergeant Major — Self-development', 'Chapter 32. Military occupational specialty 92Z professional development model', 'Sergeant Majors/Command Sergeant Majors committed to achieving high goals will develop leadership skills and have the practical knowledge and ambition to put them to good use. Ample opportunities exist for Sergeant Majors/Command Sergeant Majors to enroll in various correspondence courses to accomplish individual educational objectives. For additional information on self-development, see paragraph 2–13.', 'b71c36ad55a019bb1ebf41c2de6ed3e4e7d883c11db596bbe5faaffb51b30d58', 43, 43, null, 327, null, null, false, null),
  ('d1ac53e3-6b4c-5f77-b4cb-b1eb3f1222ff', '7bb00f17-9863-5757-a81f-7038b54c0dc1', 'Army', 'enlisted', '92Z', null, 'training', 'E-9', null, 'Sergeant Major/ Command Sergeant Major — Additional training', 'Chapter 32. Military occupational specialty 92Z professional development model', 'A Certified Logistics Association (CLA)/Certified Logistics Technician (CLT) Credentials; Certified Petroleum Professional Level 5; Food Safety Manager Certification; Culinary Institute Pro Chef Level 2-3; Certified Culinary Administrator; Certified Culinary Educator; Credentials/ Certifications (COOL, ACE), and ASU Courses.
(d) Special assignments.
